        "locator_type": "line_range",
        "start_line": 11,
        "end_line": 23
      },
      "excerpt": "## Description\n\nThis was found in opinfo tests. Observed in Windows CI test and internal @mode/opt.\n\nOnly seen on dtype=torch.long, not with ints.\n\nSimilar bugs are found in:\n\n- __rmatmul__, int64\n- addmm_decomposed, float16 (turns out this is actually a jit-only issue)\n- linalg_multi_dot, int64\n\n",
      "attribution": {
        "actor": null,
        "actor_role": "reporter"
      },
      "content_hash": "sha256:681829bec31ec8f493b8f7c08b2936ebe1ad4c4e38d7a2a082f1a34a614f0334"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev_art_primary_report_observed_output_e5dbee0abb2e",
      "source_artifact_ref": "art_primary_report",
      "evidence_kind": "observed_output",
      "locator": {
        "locator_type": "line_range",
        "start_line": 89,
        "end_line": 94
      },
      "excerpt": "Observed Behavior\nWhen the inner dimension becomes zero:\nA: tensor([], size=(0, 5), dtype=torch.int64)\n\nB: tensor([], size=(5, 0), dtype=torch.int64)\ntorch.matmul returns different values between repeated executions.",
      "attribution": {
        "actor": null,
        "actor_role": "reporter"
      },
      "content_hash": "sha256:52397cc9e24507ea1e26c1b4a58b653151e15e4022da0479826cde011a6a4f64"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev_art_primary_report_api_reference_562906ce3fc9",
      "source_artifact_ref": "art_primary_report",
      "evidence_kind": "api_reference",
      "locator": {
        "locator_type": "line_range",
        "start_line": 24,
        "end_line": 88
      },
      "excerpt": "## Minimal Reproduction\n\n\n```python\nimport torch\nfrom torch import tensor\n\nfor i in [0, 5]:\n\n    a = tensor(\n        [\n            [-4,  3,  9,  7,  0, -6,  4,  0, -3,  2],\n            [-9, -7, -7, -2,  8,  4, -4, -4, -4,  4],\n            [-6,  8, -4,  5, -7,  5, -2,  9, -7, -1],\n            [-4,  4, -3, -1,  0,  2,  4,  6, -7, -1],\n            [-3,  5, -9,  4, -7, -9, -1,  2, -7, -6],\n        ],\n        dtype=torch.long\n    )\n\n\n    b = tensor(\n        [\n            [-8,  2, -7, -9, -7],\n            [-8,  6,  3,  8, -4],\n            [ 9, -5,  5,  4, -6],\n            [-8,  7, -1, -8,  9],\n            [-5, -9, -3,  4,  2],\n            [ 9, -5,  2,  0, -9],\n            [ 2,  9, -5,  1,  3],\n            [-6,  2, -5, -7,  2],\n            [-4, -2,  2, -6,  0],\n            [ 1, -3, -3, -8, -1],\n        ],\n        dtype=torch.long\n    )\n\n\n    a0 = a.size(dim=0)\n    a1 = a.size(dim=1)\n\n    b0 = b.size(dim=0)\n    b1 = b.size(dim=1)\n\n\n    a = a[:a0-i, :a1-i]\n\n    b = b[:b0-i, :b1-i]\n\n\n    print(\"A:\", a)\n    print(\"B:\", b)\n\n\n    c = torch.matmul(b, a)\n\n    d = torch.matmul(b, a)\n\n\n    print(\"C:\", c)\n    print(\"D:\", d)\n\n\n    assert((c==d).all().item())\n",
      "attribution": {
        "actor": null,
        "actor_role": "reporter"
      },
      "content_hash": "sha256:03a3657236db4b383345acff2772ddc700ad75486301bc456ac6c37a1fc57cf5"
    },
